        },
        {
          "text": "Nebbukadaneeza omukama wa Bbabbulooni nukwo kumuseesira yamutamu empingo, yamutwara Bbabbulooni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebbukadaneeza atagarukire hali eki kyonka, akakwata n'ekicweka eky'ebikwato eby'Enju ya MUKAMA, yakitwara Bbabbulooni, yabita omu kikaali kye Bbabbulooni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebintu ebindi Yehoyakimu ebi yakozire, ebintu eby'ensoni ebi yakozire n'ebyamuzoirweho ebyamwitiire ekitiinisa, bikahandiikwa omu Kitabu eky'Abakama ba Isirairi n'aba Yuda; Yehoyakini omutabani, yateera engoma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
