        {
          "text": "Omwaka obu gukaba nigutandika, omukama Nebbukadaneeza, yatuma abantu, baamukwata baamutwaara Bbabbulooni, hamu n'ebikwato eby'omuhendo eby'Enju ya MUKAMA. Zedekiya, isento nuwe yafoora mukama wa Yuda na Yerusaalemu.",
          "type": "text",
